=======================
 dbt7-generate-queries
=======================

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7-generate-queries** [option...] dbms directory

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7-generate-queries** is the Database Test 7 (DBT-7) **dsqgen**
wrapper.  It generates query stream files outside of the execution of a
power test or throughput test, primarily to make it easy to review the
queries generated by **dsqgen**.

OPTIONS
=======

-d DIALECT, --dialect=DIALECT  *dialect* override, default matches *dbms*.
-i INPUT, --input=INPUT  *input* templates override.
-s SCALE, --scale-factor=SCALE  *scale* factor, default 1.
--seed=SEED  Typically mmddhhmmsss (e.g. date +%m%d%H%M%S%3N) where 0 makes
        all streams the same, default 0.
--split  Create a file per query; this is not to spec.
--streams=STREAMS  Number of query *streams*, default 1.
--tpcdstools=DSHOME  *dshome* is the directory location of the TPC-DS
        Tools.
-V, --version  Output version information, then exit.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

*dbms* options are:

* gp Greenplum
* pgsql PostgreSQL

*directory* is the path to save the query files.

ENVIRONMENT
===========

**DSHOME**

    This is the absolute path to the TPC-DS Tools directory.  The
    --tpcdstools argument will override this environment variable.

SEE ALSO
========

**dbt7**\ (1), **dbt7-run**\ (1), **dbt7-power-test**\ (1),
**dbt7-throughput-test**\ (1)
